WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.620
Good morning Hank. It's Tuesday, March 11th:

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:05.460
3 days before I have to turn in the first draft of the Paper Towns screenplay.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:08.240
*Theme Music*

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.800
So Hank, I was going to try to break the Question Tuesday world record today,

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.560
