00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.700
But the fact that I have no time at all today will not stop me from

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.460
answering at least some real questions from real NerdFighters!

00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.640
Question 1: Where and when is your event in Amsterdam next week?

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.780
It's on Thursday March 19th at 7 p.m.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:25.600
at...Dyaren?

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:27.620
Oh man how am I ever going to immigrate to the Netherlands

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:29.400
