00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:32.860
Anyway, info in the sidebar. Everyone in and around Amsterdam should come.

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.200
Also, quick reminder this Friday, I'm doing a fundraiser

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.240
