00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:40.920
It's $5 bucks if you're a student, $8 if you're aren't. More info in the sidebar

00:00:40.920 --> 00:00:44.100
Goose1977 asks "How do I get nerd girls to like me?"

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:47.360
I don't know that's not really my area
of expertise. Hold on, let me get Willy

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:50.900
Hey Willy!

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:55.740
Girls love you Willie! How do you do it?
Kisses?

00:00:56.720 --> 00:00:59.560
You lick their ears? I don't think that's the..

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:03.430
I don't.. at least not at first I don't
think that's the way to get it done man.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:07.510
Why do girls like you? Is it because you pee a lot, or because you bark in the house or

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:09.700
because you make a lot of weird noises?

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:13.360
Wait, is it because you're the silent, shy,
aloof, type? AHHHHH!

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:18.630
The silent, shy, aloof, type doesn't lick me in the mouth when I'm video blogging!

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:22.150
No, I think I can tell you pretty succinctly why girls like Willy. It's because he's a

00:01:22.150 --> 00:01:22.670
puppy.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:26.030
Guys, my first piece of advise about getting girls to 
like you: become a puppy.

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:29.759
A kitten would also be acceptable, or
possibly a sneezy panda bear.

00:01:29.759 --> 00:01:34.009
goose1977, I've been dumped by a lot of girls.

00:01:34.009 --> 00:01:38.060
And in the process of acquiring those broken
hearts I learned one important lesson:

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:41.090
girls don't like it when you get all
creepy stalkery on them.

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:44.100
See the problem with guys is that we're needy, but we're taught that we're not

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:47.799
allowed to be needy. So when we get in a
situation where we're allowed to be

00:01:47.799 --> 00:01:48.750
vulnerable

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:52.259
we sorta like rip it open and let the need flow out

00:01:52.259 --> 00:01:55.950
and it's kinda disgusting.
 I have this theory that girls, at least girls not

00:01:55.950 --> 00:01:59.290
named Bella, have this warning system
inside their heads and whenever we get

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:03.750
too obsessed with them and focused on
them it's like beep beeep beep beep back away

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:07.469
back away beep beep beep beep back away!
Which by the way is a totally helpful

00:02:07.469 --> 00:02:11.200
warning system, because no girl, or any
other person for that matter, will ever

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:13.030
fill up the holes inside of you!

00:02:13.030 --> 00:02:16.069
It's like Chinese finger cuffs. Do you remember
Chinese finger cuffs? The way to get

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:18.010
Chinese finger cuffs off of your fingers

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:22.030
is instead of being panicked and
overeager, just relax.

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:25.690
Oh and one other thing guys, it will be
really helpful if you can see girls as

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:29.709
like people instead pathways to kissing
and or salvation.

00:02:29.709 --> 00:02:32.599
one of the things I've noticed over the
years is that if you treat girls like

00:02:32.599 --> 00:02:36.080
people, although admittedly people who
like fart jokes somewhat less than the

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.019
rest of your friends,

00:02:37.019 --> 00:02:40.040
they are much more likely to like you.
